s Belgian detective Hercule Poirot investigates the murder of an American tycoon aboard the Orient Express train.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":322,\"title\":\"Mystic River\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hCHVDbo6XJGj3r2i4hVjKhE0GKF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ycpMe25LYpzGW42U9amyW9gM53.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The lives of three men who were childhood friends are shattered when one of them suffers a family tragedy.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":186,\"title\":\"Lucky Number Slevin\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x21s3p5wPww534nYj1cWakTcqz4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ShDHEWiJ4NL6ldn4W2m3bEkIBr.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Slevin is mistakenly put in the middle of a personal war between the city’s biggest criminal bosses. Under constant watch, Slevin must try not to get killed by an infamous assassin and come up with an idea of how to get out of his current dilemma.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":3580,\"title\":\"Changeling\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y9Qi39dL3PceGCH8afyC7QrhbhI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yWs9QUP2kamsnfdV4cloxLM5RUw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Los Angeles, 1928. When single mother Christine Collins leaves for work, her son vanishes without a trace. Five months later, the police reunite mother and son. But when Christine suspects that the boy returned to her isn't her child, her quest for truth exposes a world of corruption.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446021,\"title\":\"Bad Times at the El Royale\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qExufIc4Rw0e4xdVZlhMdmEDGES.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gb3TVVZNNxVGNfS1NxGaiWZfwnW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lake Tahoe, 1969. Seven strangers, each one with a secret to bury, meet at El Royale, a decadent motel with a dark past. In the course of a fateful night, everyone will have one last shot at redemption.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15472,\"title\":\"The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r2pFUXKK20KD9RE3yybpQsNynRE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dPE25PbaeE6fCR2SQb4H4MeBmml.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Swedish thriller based on Stieg Larsson's novel about a male journalist and a young female hacker. In the opening of the movie, Mikael Blomkvist, a middle-aged publisher for the magazine Millennium, loses a libel case brought by corrupt Swedish industrialist Hans-Erik Wennerström. Nevertheless, he is hired by Henrik Vanger in order to solve a cold case, the disappearance of Vanger's niece\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4771,\"title\":\"Gone Baby Gone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w98tAPUjNPxGAMCipNDWDt8PJo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r9qIuaPPJQuuNvGQGKHjmDxntsK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 4 year old Amanda McCready disappears from her home and the police make little headway in solving the case, the girl's aunt, Beatrice McCready hires two private detectives, Patrick Kenzie and Angie Gennaro. The detectives freely admit that they have little experience with this type of case, but the family wants them for two reasons—they're not cops and they know the tough neighborhood in which they all live.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":169917,\"title\":\"A Walk Among the Tombstones\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/euPgyPsiNFp6gOBB7nUFxvN5ZaY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k23FPWl97XKpJ1oTaDyADzxWxs6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Private investigator Matthew Scudder is hired by a drug kingpin to find out who kidnapped and murdered his wife.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":866463,\"title\":\"Reptile\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/soIgqZBoTiTgMqUW0JtxsPWAilQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nrp2khEM6JWFqqNLeub1J6Qafe0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the brutal murder of a young real estate agent, a hardened detective attempts to uncover the truth in a case where nothing is as it seems, and by doing so dismantles the illusions in his own life.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":30018,\"title\":\"Mother\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8oBnSkZE6GDVugAbLPO6uJd4GcS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mjtocjdhqJNnppHIgBesT3BBIOi.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A mother lives quietly with her son. One day, a girl is brutally killed, and the boy is charged with the murder. Now, it's his mother's mission to prove him innocent.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":799876,\"title\":\"The Outfit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lZa5EB6PVJBT5mxhgZS5ftqdAm6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jjXnYpRQMqzylAmYqKL7VFa3l9w.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Leonard is an English tailor who used to craft suits on London’s world-famous Savile Row. After a personal tragedy, he’s ended up in Chicago, operating a small tailor shop in a rough part of town where he makes beautiful clothes for the only people around who can afford them: a family of vicious gangsters.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9616,\"title\":\"The Order\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7kj4TffoKCt4gIrNupr2oqmir69.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7KBJf963tZBijpP6bKOJrxkowGp.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For centuries, a secret Order of priests has existed within the Church. A renegade priest, Father Alex Bernier, is sent to Rome to investigate the mysterious death of one of the Order's most revered members. Following a series of strangely similar killings, Bernier launches an investigation that forces him to confront unimaginable evil.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"cCJHyIL9xJE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"0Uc4M9JvL0g\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"DQJHwhVGD5Q\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":190}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}